    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Principle 11. Weekends"
    },
    {
      "type": "sentences",
      "items": [
        {
          "n": "130",
          "text": "On Saturday we only have classes in the morning."
        },
        {
          "n": "131",
          "text": "On Saturday afternoon I usually spend my time with my friends."
        },
        {
          "n": "132",
          "text": "Sometimes there is a special day like a birthday party."
        },
        {
          "n": "133",
          "text": "On Saturday my family likes to go out for dinner."
        },
        {
          "n": "134",
          "text": "While we're having dinner we talk about many things."
        },
        {
          "n": "135",
          "text": "My family is interested in what is going on in my life."
        },
        {
          "n": "136",
          "text": "My family is Christian."
        },
        {
          "n": "137",
          "text": "We go to church every Sunday morning."
        },
        {
          "n": "138",
          "text": "I have many friends at church."
        },
        {
          "n": "139",
          "text": "Other families may go hiking, shopping or play sports on Sunday."
        },
        {
          "n": "140",
          "text": "I sometimes visit our grandparents or relatives."
        },
        {
          "n": "141",
          "text": "I like to visit my relatives because I am able to see my cousins."
        },
        {
          "n": "142",
          "text": "I also like to visit my father's friends because their children are"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "the same age as me."
    },
    {
      "type": "sentences",
      "items": [
        {
          "n": "143",
          "text": "We always have a great time."
        }
      ]
    },
